    <h1>PRD Pre-work</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Document unified access form workflow and behaviors:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"743a4bf6-1892-48cc-9d3f-500bfa2a93b5">How does the form g=
et populated</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5f112d1b-d520-40dd-8444-d25543d72e1c">What do the options=
 map to</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"41d518c3-2b01-4738-955b-917231ea06da">How does it turn th=
ose selections into tasks</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"84cab5ea-077b-4c14-b929-fd5497cc3b56">Where do they go /&=
nbsp;how do they configure</li>
</ul>
<p>Complete the mapping analysis for CX to R2 user profile sync:&nbsp; <spa=
n class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">FEB</span> <span c=
lass=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge">PA</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7445301f-8b58-42a6-9ba1-2053923abda0">Re-inventory of all=
 R2 features left by end of Q3 that needs to be controlled</li>
