 <li data-uuid=3D"a58fbb50-8dd1-4657-a331-81b718605654">End-to-end across a=
ll systems</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2f67edbe-1291-4f13-b6bc-43a32bbfd0d5">IB creation + updat=
e, PM creation + update</li>
</ul>
<p>Impact / opportunity&nbsp;assessment for external SSO support:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bba61aee-e335-4ff7-9578-606bc24f52d9">Refresh the step-by=
